+
+Baseline: exact V50.20.0 repository.
+
+Extract `BLUE-CURRENT-V50.25.0-PATCH.zip` into the root of `blue-current-reservations`, preserving directories and replacing matching files.
+
+Validate:
+
+```powershell
+taskkill /F /IM node.exe
